 CX and MGR wrote the paper.</p></fn><fn id="ack2" fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding.</bold> The work was supported by the Keck Foundation for the purchase of an FEI CM300 electron microscope and by the National Institutes of Health grant AI11219 to MGR. The funders had no role in the design of the study, data collection and analysis, decision to publish, or preparation of the manuscript.</p></fn><fn id="ack3" fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing interests.</bold> The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>